menu "AnyMouse mouse drivers"

config AMV_OPENMOUSE_JS
    bool "Run OpenMouse's own drivers in QuickJS (components/amv_js)"
    default y
    help
        Every mouse OpenMouse supports is driven by OpenMouse's unchanged TypeScript drivers in
        the QuickJS engine (needs PSRAM). Off: the four C ports (Razer, Finalmouse, GearHub,
        Logitech) are used instead.

endmenu
